+            <p><strong>Shown: selected historical E6 media.</strong> These clips are illustrations, not the E7 benchmark grid. Earlier temporal mixing across clean frame 0 produced global luma ringing (27.4 frames; flicker index 0.505; <a href="#5634">#5634</a>). E7 corrected that boundary: its temporal donor arm had 8/16 clean clips, but 0/16 within 10% of the real period.</p>
